IMAPAccount fastmail
Host imap.fastmail.com
Port 993
AuthMechs LOGIN
User kimsaram32@fastmail.com
PassCmd "gpg -q --for-your-eyes-only -d ~/.authinfo.gpg | awk -F ' ' '/kimsaram32@fastmail.com/ { print $(NF-2); exit; }'"
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore fastmail-remote
Account fastmail

MaildirStore fastmail-local
Path ~/mail/
Inbox ~/mail/INBOX
# The 'Trash' option is unnecessary here (see the manual for details).
SubFolders Verbatim

# About message deletion: the 'Gone' synchronization option propagates message
# deletions only by marking the corresponding messages as deleted. Actual
# deletion of the marked messages is enabled by setting the 'Expunge' option.
Channel fastmail
Far :fastmail-remote:
Near :fastmail-local:
Patterns *
Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
Sync New Upgrade Flags Gone
Create Near
SyncState *
